    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκράς</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾶτος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔκρατος</span>
			, <i>temperate, of even temperature</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρήνη εὐκρὰς πρὸς χειμῶνα καὶ θέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					112d
				</span></i>
			; of climate, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.1.4
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστιν οἷς βίος ὁ
				μικρὸς εὐκρὰς ἐγένεθ</span>' <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				504
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονή</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				197
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>mixed for drinking</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					6.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of persons,
				<i>mixing readily with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ πολλοῖς
				εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.105
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i>). (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔκρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					197
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
			</span></i>)</div>
